    "title": "How to get a free Dunkin' coffee on April Fools' Day",
    "text": "April 1, 2026, 8:00 a.m. ETDunkin' is giving away just over a million coffees on April 1 in honor of April Fools' Day. Well, 1,000,001, to be exact.\"Last April Fools', we gave away a million free coffees, and some of you thought it was a prank. We didn't forget that. So this year, we're doing it again. Just a little bigger,\" the company said in a news release.\"April Fools’ might come with some trust issues, but we’re here to help you get through it,\" Dunkin' said in the news release. \"Whether you’re dodging office pranks or scrolling past one too many fake announcements, we’ve got your back – and your coffee.\"How to get a free Dunkin' coffeeThe offer is only available for Dunkin' Rewards members, according to the company. Rewards members can claim the deal by entering the promo code \"StillNotAJoke\" when ordering on the Dunkin' app.Rewards members can get their free coffee hot or iced and in any size: small, medium or large. Once the code is added, it's valid for seven days. Cold brew or an extra-large hot coffee are not eligible for the deal. There is a limit of one per customer.More April Fools' Day dealsDunkin' isn't the only one dropping deals for April 1. See our list.Contributing: Greta Cross and Julia Gomez, USA TODAYGabe Hauari is a national trending news reporter at USA TODAY. You can follow him on X @GabeHauari or email him at Gdhauari@gannett.com.",
